OL,3,GNEWSACandidates named in six-way
OL,4,Aby-election race
OL,5,
OL,6,FCandidates have been confirmed for an
OL,7,Fupcoming Leicestershire County Council
OL,8,Fby-election.
OL,10,FVoters in Shepshed will go to the polls
OL,11,Fon 15 October to choose a successor to
OL,12,FReform UK councillor Helen Butler, who
OL,13,Fresigned her seat in August.
OL,15,FThe campaign will be a six-way contest
OL,16,Fbetween Reform, Labour, the Green
OL,17,FParty, the Conservatives, the Liberal
OL,18,FDemocrats and Restore Britain.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
